  "headExtra": "<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://videos.quickler.co\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cA fifth, if not a sixth of the time.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how little of the time goes on the task itself when you give Quickler a voice note and spend the rest of it with people.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT22S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"Then think for three or four sentences and give that to Quickler as a voice note. And that is so efficient that we're maybe only spending a fifth, if not a sixth of the time actually doing the task. We spend the rest of the remaining time interacting with people, which is what we're there to do.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cI wouldn\\u2019t hesitate to recommend it to anybody else.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on why he would recommend Quickler to anybody, and how people react when he shows it to them.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-recommend-it-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-recommend-it.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"And the time that's saved is very useful time. I wouldn't hesitate to recommend it to anybody else. Everybody I've ever shown it to almost looks on with a gaze of wonder to say, oh, how is it doing that? As we said previously, it looks deceptively simple. And so it looks like an aspirational piece of technology that will take the hard work out of a repeatable, standardized task.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cOn average, between five to ten minutes.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how long it takes to edit a report in Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT23S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"So now compared to before, the beauty with Quickler is we actually can see how long it takes to edit the report. It's taking, on average, between five to ten minutes. And some of this is actually because we've chosen to leave the activity of adding certain things until we go back to the office.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cIt\\u2019s a one and done, basically.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on finishing an inspection in one go and moving straight on to other tasks.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-one-and-done-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT35S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-one-and-done.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"We're actually doing other work. So we're able to top and tail the inspection activity much quicker than we did before. So we're moving on to other tasks. So we're almost able to do them completely in exclusion of any other activity and then move straight on to something else. So there is no requirement to revisit the task. So it's a one and done, basically. So we're using the other time to move quickly, swiftly and efficiently onto other tasks.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cReally working in the field without any sort of support.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on the moment Quickler really worked for his team in the field.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT35S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was when we saw it really working in the field without any sort of support. And what I mean by that is we were able to do exactly the same as we did before report wise, but we were able to do it quicker and we were able to do it slicker. So what I mean by that is that we had the ability to actually generate a high quality report that needed very minimal admin or tidying up afterwards. And we were then able to bounce from that job to the next job.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cWe\\u2019re not there to write a list of faults.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on spending the time saved changing people\\u2019s behaviour on health and safety.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-not-a-list-of-faults-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT31S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-not-a-list-of-faults.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"We spend the rest of the remaining time interacting with people, which is what we're there to do. We're there to actually change people's behaviours on health and safety. We're not there to write a list of faults or a list of problems because that's neither constructive nor helpful to our clients. So what we can do with Quickler is we can quickly illustrate the topics and we can physically give them a report that is easy for them to interact with.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: \\u201cIt was deceptively easy.\\u201d\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how easy it was to capture the data on site with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was deceptively easy. And what I mean by deceptively easy is it didn't feel like we were doing enough on site to capture the data that we desired. It felt almost like we weren't putting enough effort in using Quickler because it was deceptively easy to capture the data by purely just describing it or just taking a short series of photographs.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}]}</script>",
